## 4. Comprehensive Module Specifications (Pin-to-Pin Detail)

### Module 1: Authentication & Identity Management
* **Description:** Manages multi-role portal login, self-registration, password validation, and token verification.
* **Core Functions:**
  * `POST /api/auth/login`: Validates user email/password, matches role, and returns `accessToken`, `user` payload, and profile details.
  * `POST /api/auth/register`: Onboards new user accounts (Admin, Teacher, Student, Parent, Accountant) with input validation (minimum 6-char password, 10-digit phone, email format).
* **Validation & Security Constraints:**
  * Mandatory email format check via Zod.
  * Checks unique email constraints in `users` database table.

### Module 2: Institutional Infrastructure & Hierarchy
* **Description:** Defines campus structural components: Academic Years, Departments, Classes, and Sections.
* **Core Functions:**
  * **Academic Years:** Manages active school terms (e.g. `2025-2026`) with `start_date` and `end_date` flags.
  * **Departments:** Creates academic divisions (e.g., Science, Humanities) with custom department codes (e.g., `SCI`, `HUM`) and links Head of Department (HOD) faculty.
  * **Classes & Sections:** Divides grade levels (e.g., Grade 10) into sections (e.g., Section A, Section B), assigning designated Room Numbers (e.g., Room 101) and Faculty Advisory Teachers.

### Module 3: Student Information Management System (SIMS)
* **Description:** End-to-end lifecycle management of student profiles from admission to graduation.
* **Data Fields Tracked:** Admission Number (Unique), Roll Number, First/Last Name, Class ID, Section ID, Parent Linkage (Parent ID), Date of Birth, Gender, Address, Status (`Active`, `Suspended`, `Graduated`, `Transferred`).
* **Core Functions:**
  * `GET /api/students`: Filterable list by class, section, status, and search query.
  * `POST /api/students`: Enrolls new student, creates associated user credentials, and links to parent profile by parent email.
  * `PUT /api/students/:id`: Updates student placement or status.
  * `DELETE /api/students/:id`: Removes student profile with cascading cleanup.

### Module 4: Faculty & Staff Information System (FIMS)
* **Description:** Manages teaching staff profiles, department assignments, qualifications, and employment statuses.
* **Data Fields Tracked:** First/Last Name, Email, Phone (10 digits), Department ID, Qualification (e.g., M.Sc Chemistry, Ph.D. Physics), Joining Date, Status (`Active`, `Inactive`, `OnLeave`).
* **Core Functions:**
  * `GET /api/teachers`: Lists faculty members with assigned department details and assigned classes.
  * `POST /api/teachers`: Creates faculty profile and user credentials.
  * `PUT /api/teachers/:id`: Modifies teacher department, status, or contact numbers.

### Module 5: Academic Scheduling & Timetable Engine
* **Description:** Conflict-free timetable generator and schedule viewer for classes and teachers.
* **Database Constraint:** `UNIQUE(class_id, section_id, day_of_week, start_time)` prevents double-booking classroom slots or sections.
* **Core Functions:**
  * `GET /api/timetables/class/:classId/:sectionId`: Fetches full weekly schedule grid for a section.
  * `GET /api/timetables/teacher/:teacherId`: Fetches personalized weekly teaching schedule for a teacher.
  * `POST /api/timetables`: Creates schedule slot (Day 1-5, Subject, Teacher, Room, Start/End Time).
  * `DELETE /api/timetables/:id`: Removes schedule entry.

### Module 6: Digital Attendance Tracking & Register
* **Description:** Multi-tier attendance recording system for daily rosters or subject-specific class periods.
* **Attendance Statuses:** `Present`, `Absent`, `Late`, `Excused`.
* **Core Functions:**
  * `POST /api/attendance`: Submits bulk class attendance records for a specified date, class, section, and optional subject.
  * `GET /api/attendance/summary`: Aggregates percentage metrics (Present vs Absent vs Late rates) for dashboard charts.
  * `GET /api/attendance/student/:studentId`: Retrieves complete student attendance history for parent/student review.

### Module 7: Examination, Grading & GPA Analytics Engine
* **Description:** Comprehensive examination management, marks entry, automatic letter grade conversion, and GPA calculation.
* **Grade Scale Formula:**
  * **A+ (90% - 100%):** Grade Point 4.00
  * **A (80% - 89%):** Grade Point 3.70
  * **B (70% - 79%):** Grade Point 3.00
  * **C (60% - 69%):** Grade Point 2.00
  * **F (Below 60%):** Grade Point 0.00
* **Core Functions:**
  * `POST /api/exams`: Creates exam term (e.g. "Term 1 Final Examination").
  * `POST /api/exams/grades`: Records exam score (`marks_obtained` capped at `max_marks`), calculates `letter_grade` and `grade_point`, and stores teacher remarks.
  * `GET /api/exams/student/:studentId`: Generates complete report card transcript with cumulative GPA.

### Module 8: Homework, Assignments & File Submission Portal
* **Description:** Digital assignment publishing, PDF/Document link submission, and grading workflow.
* **Core Functions:**
  * `POST /api/assignments`: Teachers publish homework with title, description, subject, class, section, due date, and max marks.
  * `POST /api/assignments/submit`: Students submit work with URL links (PDF/Cloud link) and student notes.
  * `PUT /api/assignments/submissions/:id/grade`: Teachers award marks, provide feedback remarks, and mark status as `Graded`.

### Module 9: Finance, Tuition Fees & Transaction Ledger
* **Description:** Complete student fee structuring, invoice generation, transaction processing, and revenue reporting.
* **Payment Methods Supported:** `Card`, `Cash`, `BankTransfer`, `ChequeDD`.
* **Payment Lifecycle States:** `Paid`, `Pending`, `Failed`.
* **Core Functions:**
  * `POST /api/payments/structures`: Creates tuition fee templates per class (e.g., "Grade 10 Annual Tuition Fee - $2,500").
  * `POST /api/payments`: Records fee payments with unique transaction references, bank account numbers, or cheque numbers.
  * `GET /api/payments/student/:studentId`: Fetches paid vs pending invoices for parents.
  * `GET /api/analytics/overview`: Aggregates total campus revenue and 6-month financial trends.

### Module 10: AI Academic Assistant & Predictive Intelligence (Google Gemini)
* **Description:** Integrated artificial intelligence engine leveraging `gemini-1.5-flash` with smart local fallback.
* **Capabilities:**
  1. **Academic Assistant Tutor (`POST /api/ai/assistant`):** Context-aware educational chatbot that analyzes student profile, recent grades, and attendance data to answer academic questions.
  2. **Automated At-Risk Prediction (`GET /api/ai/insights/:studentId`):** Evaluates academic performance and absence counts to return structured JSON:
     * `trend`: `"improving" | "stable" | "critical"`
     * `riskLevel`: `"low" | "medium" | "high"`
     * `strengths`: `string[]`
     * `suggestions`: `string[]`
  3. **Report Card AI Summarizer (`GET /api/ai/report-summary/:studentId`):** Synthesizes exam marks lists into professional markdown performance summaries for parents.

### Module 11: Standard Operating Procedures (SOP) & Policy Hub (Bilingual + RTL)
* **Description:** Institutional guideline center for admissions, grading policies, safety procedures, and fee collection SOPs.
* **Bilingual Architecture:** Stores double-language data fields (`title`, `title_ar`, `description`, `description_ar`, `steps`, `steps_ar`).
* **Core Functions:**
  * `POST /api/sops/translate`: Sends English SOP title, description, and steps to Gemini AI to generate authentic Arabic translations automatically (with local dictionary fallback).
  * **RTL Rendering:** SOP viewer dynamically switches layout direction (`dir="rtl"`) when Arabic mode is toggled, re-aligning step timelines, bullet indicators, and text elements.

### Module 12: Executive Analytics & KPI Dashboards
* **Description:** Real-time business intelligence for school leaders and administrators.
* **Metrics Tracked:** Total Active Students, Total Faculty Count, Active Departments Count, Cumulative Revenue, Monthly Revenue Trends (Chart), Campus Attendance Ratios, Recent System Activities.

