## 5. Detailed User Portal Specs (7 Campus Personas)

### 5.1 Administrator Portal
* **Dashboard Overview:** Comprehensive system overview with 4 KPI cards, financial charts, and quick-action toolbars.
* **Management Hubs:** Full CRUD management tabs for Students, Teachers, Departments, Classes, Timetables, Fee Structures, and SOP Policies.
* **SOP Builder:** Interactive modal to build step-by-step SOPs with "Auto-Translate to Arabic 🌐" AI button.

### 5.2 Principal Portal
* **Executive Oversight:** Read-only access across all campus departments, academic records, and financial statements.
* **Workload Monitoring:** View faculty-to-student ratios, classroom occupancy rates, and institutional performance metrics.

### 5.3 Head of Department (HOD) Portal
* **Department Supervision:** Specialized focus on assigned department faculty, course subjects, and departmental student performance.
* **Timetable Scheduling:** Oversees section allocations and teacher subject distributions.

### 5.4 Faculty Teacher Portal
* **Attendance Module:** Interactive daily roster sheet to mark student attendance status with 1-click status toggles.
* **Gradebook Sheet:** Enter exam scores with instant max-marks validation and automatic grade calculations.
* **Homework Manager:** Publish assignments, review incoming student submissions, inspect file attachments, and record grades.
* **My Schedule:** Weekly calendar grid displaying assigned teaching slots and room numbers.

### 5.5 Enrolled Student Portal
* **My Report Card:** Visual breakdown of letter grades, GPA score (e.g. 3.70 / 4.00), and AI-generated report summaries.
* **Assignment Hub:** List of pending vs submitted homework with document URL upload modal.
* **Timetable:** Interactive daily class schedule.
* **EduSync AI Chatbot:** Personal AI virtual tutor for homework help and exam preparation guidance.

### 5.6 Linked Parent / Guardian Portal
* **Child Overview:** Combined dashboard showing child's attendance rate (e.g. 95%), current GPA, and upcoming exam dates.
* **School Bills & Invoices:** View itemized fee structures, check payment statuses, and make payments with instant receipt confirmation.
* **Bilingual Guidelines:** Read official school policies and SOPs with a 1-click English / Arabic RTL toggle.

### 5.7 Campus Accountant Portal
* **Fee Structure Management:** Create and edit tuition fees, term fees, lab fees, and transport fees.
* **Payment Ledger:** Log manual cash/cheque payments, verify transaction reference codes, and view revenue analytics charts.

