## 10. Deployment Models, Security & Compliance

### 10.1 Flexible Deployment Architecture
* **Cloud Hosted (SaaS):** Containerized Docker deployment on AWS / Google Cloud Platform (GCP) with managed PostgreSQL (RDS/Cloud SQL) and automated daily backups.
* **On-Premises Campus Server:** Local Docker Compose deployment for institutions requiring local database isolation behind institutional firewalls.

### 10.2 Security & Data Privacy Compliance
* **Data Encryption:** TLS 1.3 encryption in transit; AES-256 encryption at rest for database backups.
* **Educational Data Privacy Compliance:** Designed in accordance with student privacy frameworks (FERPA / GDPR equivalent compliance standards).
* **Audit Logging:** System notifications and PostgreSQL update triggers log administrative data changes for audit trails.

